WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
Build habits around unique passwords, MFA and phishing.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:07.582
Do not open the link or share the code.

00:00:07.582 --> 00:00:11.145
Contact school IT using a known official address and report the message.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:15.764
What is the safest response to an unexpected OTP request?

00:00:15.764 --> 00:00:17.574
An OTP can grant access.

00:00:17.574 --> 00:00:21.555
Never disclose it, even to a person claiming to be support.
